# Slot-end-tag integration branch

All Layout A / Block-map / chase / related header-layout work for this project lands on:

**`cursor/slot-end-tag-dev-dc92`** (integration / “master dev” branch)

## Workflow

- Cut **subbranches** from `cursor/slot-end-tag-dev-dc92` (names still `cursor/<desc>-dc92`).
- When a chunk is done and reviewed: **`git merge`** the subbranch into `cursor/slot-end-tag-dev-dc92` (no PR for integration-branch merges).
- **Do not merge to `main`** until the full effort is finished and Michael is confident in the result.
- Open a PR to **`main` only** for the final cutover (explicit ask).

## Order reminder

Prefer header-layout (`impl/` + slab split) before Block-registry code; chase bench may parallelize. Spec: `docs/design/slot-end-tag.md`.
